      "description": "<p>An animate dream's touch fills the victim's mind with terrifying visions</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> DC 24 Fortitude Saving Throw</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> Fatigued (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> fatigued and Stupefied 1 (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> The victim falls Unconscious and can't be awakened as long as they remain at this stage (1 day).</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
  ],
  "spellcastingEntries": [
    {
